   "": {
    "actClause": "AN ACT making appropriations for the support of government and to amend\nchapter 111 of the laws of 2024 relating to making appropriations for the\nsupport of government, in relation thereto, and providing for the repeal of\nsuch provisions upon expiration thereof",
    "basePrintNo": "S8970",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S8970-2023",
